      "writtenOn": "2022-09-22T16:41:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nit: prefer\n```\n{\n  let _guard \u003d handle.enter();\n  // code here\n}\n```\n\nIt makes the scope the guard is held for more visibly obvious and avoids accidental patterns of:\nacquire A\nacquire B\nrelease A\nrelease B\nwhich is possible with explicit drop usage.",
      "revId": "eb0828af0c923a1895116b2d6312d3a1af75289a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
